{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "skills": {
    "paths": [".claude/skills"]
  },
  "instructions": [
    "APC_PLUGINS_DIR is read from ~/.config/acp/config.json via scripts/acp-config.sh plugins-dir. If config is missing or setup_complete=false, run /setup first. Legacy plugins remain in plugins/ inside the repo.",
    "JUCE_DIR = ~/JUCE (JUCE 9, non _tools/JUCE che è JUCE 8)",
    "JUCE 8→9 breaking: Drawable non eredita Component (usa DrawableComponent wrapper), SVG createFromSVG(XmlElement&) rimosso (usa createFromSVGFile/String), multi-touch Windows richiede usesWindowsMultiTouch(), Linux EGL non GLX (installa libegl-dev)",
    "Usa scripts/build-and-install.sh per build, mai cmake manuale",
    "Plugin CMakeLists NON devono chiamare juce_add_modules (duplicate target error)"
  ]
}
